---
import { siteConfig } from '@/data/site.config';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<footer class="mt-auto border-t border-border-subtle bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-6 gap-8 mb-12">
      <!-- Brand Mission -->
      <div class="sm:col-span-2 md:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-tr from-tech-emerald to-tech-cyan p-0.5 shadow-glow">
            <div class="w-full h-full bg-slate-900 rounded-[5px] flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="font-bold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-tech-emerald to-tech-cyan text-xs">AX</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-100 text-base">{siteConfig.name}</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">({siteConfig.brandName})</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          基于 TrendMatrix Core 打造的中文互联网机场代理生态数据平台。秉承客观中立原则，提供真实可信的专线评测、前沿协议解析、客户端配置与风险跑路预警。
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1">
          <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-ping"></div>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-emerald-400 font-mono">Real-time Matrix Engine Active</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 1: Matrix Hub -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 tracking-wider uppercase">机场矩阵</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="/providers" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">综合矩阵排行榜</a></li>
          <li><a href="/recommend" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">智能选型向导</a></li>
          <li><a href="/compare/guangsucloud-vs-xingdaomeng" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">双雄横向对比</a></li>
          <li><a href="/routes" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">IEPL/IPLC 专线对比</a></li>
          <li><a href="/protocols" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">VLESS / Hy2 协议百科</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 2: Clients -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 tracking-wider uppercase">客户端中枢</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="/client/clash-verge" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">Clash Verge Rev 教程</a></li>
          <li><a href="/client/shadowrocket" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">Shadowrocket (小火箭)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/client/sing-box" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">sing-box 通用内核</a></li>
          <li><a href="/client/v2rayn" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">v2rayN Windows 实战</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 3: Solutions & Risk -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 tracking-wider uppercase">场景与风险</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="/ai" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">ChatGPT / Claude 专区</a></li>
          <li><a href="/streaming" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">4K/8K 流媒体解锁</a></li>
          <li><a href="/risks" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 text-rose-400 font-medium">
            <span>跑路与风险库</span>
            <span class="px-1 py-0.2 rounded text-[9px] bg-rose-500/20 border border-rose-500/30">LIVE</span>
          </a></li>
          <li><a href="/articles" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">知识库与故障排查</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 4: Trust & Compliance (E-E-A-T) -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 tracking-wider uppercase">信任与合规</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">关于我们与准则</a></li>
          <li><a href="/methodology" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">评测方法与标准</a></li>
          <li><a href="/disclosure" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">商业推广透明披露</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">隐私政策 (零日志)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/terms" class="hover:text-tech-cyan transition-colors">服务条款与免责</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Commercial Disclosure Banner -->
    <div class="mb-6 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-850 text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-300 font-bold mb-1">
        <Icon name="shield-check" class="w-4 h-4 text-tech-emerald" />
        <span>客观评测与商业披露说明 (Affiliate & Non-Affiliation Disclosure)</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        本站部分出站链接包含商业推荐合作。若您通过本站链接下单，本站可能获得少许佣金用于维持自建 9Gbps 测速服务器与探针集群运营开支，但这<strong>绝不会增加您的实际支付金额</strong>，且部分可享受专属折扣减免。本站与所列服务商保持纯粹第三方监督关系，无任何股权或人事隶属关联，评分严格遵循真实链路数据与履约声誉。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar & Strict Disclaimer -->
    <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-900/90 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px] text-slate-500">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
        <span>© {siteConfig.since}–2026 {siteConfig.name} ({siteConfig.url}). All rights reserved.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <span>学术科研用途：本站仅供网络通信协议学习、科研与跨国学术检索参考，严禁用于任何违反当地法律法规之用途。</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
